Aerie-Purpose: Build the sidebar view when the layout becomes the sidebar and take it away, with the toolbar returned, when it becomes a horizontal one.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/views/frame (browser_view.cc, browser_view.h, vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc, vertical_tab_strip_region_view.h), chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar (toolbar_view.cc, toolbar_view.h)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #186. The sidebar view moves out of the region's constructor into AddAerieSidebar, SetAerieSidebarEnabled builds or removes it, ReleaseAerieToolbar gives the toolbar parts back, and BrowserView updates the frame tint for the layout. No restart.

